        <dl class="dl-horizontal">

            <dt>Concept UI</dt><dd>M0361071</dd>

            
                <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>The systematic study of the complete <a href="/record/ui?ui=D004247" class="textLink_DNA">DNA</a> sequences (<a href="/record/ui?ui=D016678" class="textLink_GENOME">GENOME</a>) of organisms. Included is construction of complete genetic, physical, and transcript maps, and the analysis of this structural genomic information on a global scale such as in <a href="/record/ui?ui=D055106" class="textLink_GENOMEWIDEASSOCIATIONSTUDIES">GENOME WIDE ASSOCIATION STUDIES</a>.</dd>
            

